ng. Its workflow, including sequential iodoTMT labeling, LC-MS/MS, SIESTA, targeted tandem mass spectrometry, SDS-PAGE, and statistical analysis, does not demonstrate that TMT-based quantification can reliably detect compound-dependent thermal shifts, and the supplied excerpt lacks numerical fold changes, confidence scores, p-values, comparisons to baselines, cell type, sample size, TMT plex, instrument model, LC-MS/MS parameters, temperature, and statistical thresholds. This means it cannot support the proposed TMTPro 16-plex implementation, the 384-hour instrument-time budget, or the proposed high-confidence thermal stability change criteria.",
